flowchart TD
  %% =========================
  %% POS Onboarding + Usage
  %% =========================

  A[Start] --> B[Fleet Admin: Open POS Onboarding]
  B --> C[Create POS Organization<br/>Brand, legal, tax info]
  C --> D[Add POS Locations<br/>Address, hours, capabilities]
  D --> E[Upload Compliance Docs]
  E --> F{Compliance Review Passed?}

  G --> E

  F -- Yes --> H[Create POS Users<br/>Map to Org + Location]
  H --> I[Create Fleet ↔ POS Contract<br/>Allowed services, limits, SLA]
  I --> J[Activate POS]

  J --> K[POS User Login]
  K --> L[Session contains role=pos<br/>posOrgId + posLocationId]
  L --> M[Load POS Dashboard<br/>Scoped to org/location]

  M --> N[Search Vehicle Plate]
  N --> O[Fetch Fleet + Driver + Active Contract]

  O --> P{Contract Active for this POS?}
  P -- No --> Q[Block Booking / Raise Approval]
  P -- Yes --> R{Service + Price Within Contract Rules?}

  R -- No --> S[Approval Required / Validation Warning]
  R -- Yes --> T[Create Service Order]

  S --> U[Manager Decision]
  U -- Approved --> T
  U -- Rejected --> V[Show Rejection Reason]

  T --> W[Track Lifecycle<br/>Draft → Submitted → Approved/Rejected → Completed]
  W --> X[Billing & Settlement]
  X --> Y[Analytics & Reporting]
  Y --> Z[End]